      "id": "npc_lymphoma_workup",
      "label": "Atypical lymphoid infiltrate — work-up",
      "auto": {
        "flag": "atypicalLymphoid"
      },
      "text": "The atypical lymphoid infiltrate will be characterised with a lymphoid immunohistochemical panel (including CD3, CD20, PAX5, cytokeratin and EBER in-situ hybridisation) to exclude an EBV-associated lymphoproliferative disorder or lymphoma; a supplementary report will follow."
    },
    {
      "id": "npc_ebv_staging",
      "label": "Plasma EBV DNA / staging correlation",
      "auto": {
